### 4. Article change status
PUT localhost:8081/api/v1/article/moderator/744634f8-42fb-4925-9827-85b726fe1a97/status
Authorization:  Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type:  application/json

{
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### 5. Get last N Article By sectionId
GET localhost:8081/api/v1/article/section/1


### 6. Get last 12 published Article except given id list ordered_by_created_date
POST localhost:8081/api/v1/article/last-12
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exceptArticleIdList": ["9d60fc1e-e21f-48c7-8c3f-562d104b3a76","a2920bb3-8863-472a-b5d0-3df04da0be0d"]
}

### 7. Get Last N Article by categoryId.
GET localhost:8081/api/v1/article/by-category/1/10


### 8. Get Last N Article by regionId.
GET localhost:8081/api/v1/article/by-region/1/10


### 9. Get Article By Id And Lang
