###  12. Get 4 most read articles, except given article id
GET localhost:8081/api/v1/article/most-read/10033343-c8dc-4877-8496-b438b82d967f


###  13. Increase Article View Count by Article Id
GET localhost:8081/api/v1/article/view-count/10033343-c8dc-4877-8496-b438b82d967f


###  14. Increase Article Share Count by Article Id
GET localhost:8081/api/v1/article/shared-count/10033343-c8dc-4877-8496-b438b82d967f


